sequenceDiagram
    participant Main as ProximaDB::new
    participant MC as MetricsCollector
    participant SS as SharedServices
    participant CS as CollectionService
    participant DVS as DirectVectorService
    participant SE as StorageEngine
    participant QE as QueryEngine
    participant MS as MultiServer
    participant REST as REST Server
    participant GRPC as gRPC Server
    
    Note over Main:  ProximaDB Initialization Sequence
    
    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Main,MC: Phase 1: Core Services Creation
        
        Main->>Main: 1. Load configuration<br/>(demo/docker-config.toml)
        
        Main->>MC: 2. Create MetricsCollector
        activate MC
        MC->>MC: Initialize metrics config
        MC->>MC: Setup metrics receiver
        MC-->>Main: Arc<MetricsCollector> ready
        deactivate MC
    end
    
    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Main,DVS: Phase 2: SharedServices Creation (Avoids Circular Dependencies)
        
        Main->>SS: 3. Create SharedServices FIRST
        activate SS
        SS->>CS: Create CollectionService
        activate CS
        CS->>CS: Initialize metadata store
        CS->>CS: Setup collection providers
        CS-->>SS: CollectionService ready
        deactivate CS
        
        SS->>DVS: Create DirectVectorService
        activate DVS
        DVS->>DVS: Initialize dual-engine support
        DVS->>DVS: Setup memtable access
        DVS-->>SS: DirectVectorService ready
        deactivate DVS
        
        SS-->>Main: Return (SharedServices, CollectionService)
        deactivate SS
        
        Note over SS:  All services unified under SharedServices
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over Main,SE: Phase 3: Storage Engine Creation
        
        Main->>SE: 4. Create StorageEngine<br/>(without CollectionService)
        activate SE
        SE->>SE: Initialize storage backends
        SE->>SE: Setup VIPER engine
        SE->>SE: Setup SST engine
        SE-->>Main: StorageEngine ready
        deactivate SE
        
        Main->>SE: 5. Inject CollectionService<br/>from SharedServices
        activate SE
        SE->>SE: set_metadata_provider(collection_service)
        SE-->>Main: CollectionService injected
        deactivate SE
        
        Note over SE:  No duplicate CollectionService created
    end
    
    rect rgb(240, 230, 255)
        Note over Main,MS: Phase 4: Network Layer Setup
        
        Main->>QE: 6. Create QueryEngine
        activate QE
        QE->>QE: Initialize SQL parser
        QE->>QE: Setup query planner
        QE-->>Main: QueryEngine ready
        deactivate QE
        
        Main->>Main: 7. Configure server addresses<br/>REST: bind_address:5678<br/>gRPC: bind_address:5679
        
        Main->>MS: 8. Create MultiServer<br/>with SharedServices
        activate MS
        MS->>MS: Setup HTTP configuration
        MS->>MS: Setup gRPC configuration
        MS->>MS: Configure TLS if enabled
        MS-->>Main: MultiServer ready
        deactivate MS
    end
    
    Note over Main:  ProximaDB::new() Complete
    
    rect rgb(255, 255, 230)
        Note over Main,GRPC: Phase 5: Startup Sequence (ProximaDB::start)
        
        Main->>SE: 9. Start StorageEngine
        activate SE
        SE->>SE: Recover collections from metadata
        SE->>SE: Initialize storage paths
        SE->>SE: Load engine configurations
        SE-->>Main: Collections recovered
        deactivate SE
        
        Main->>SS: 10. Recover vectors from write buffer
        activate SS
        SS->>SE: Get recovered collections
        SS->>SS: Scan write buffer directories
        SS->>SS: Load unflushed vectors into memtable
        SS-->>Main: Vectors recovered
        deactivate SS
        
        Main->>MS: 11. Start MultiServer
        activate MS
        MS->>REST: Start REST server (port 5678)
        activate REST
        REST->>REST: Setup Axum routes
        REST->>REST: Configure unified handlers
        REST-->>MS: REST server started
        deactivate REST
        
        MS->>GRPC: Start gRPC server (port 5679)
        activate GRPC
        GRPC->>GRPC: Setup Tonic services
        GRPC->>GRPC: Configure proto handlers
        GRPC-->>MS: gRPC server started
        deactivate GRPC
        
        MS-->>Main: Servers running
        deactivate MS
    end
    
    Note over Main,GRPC:  ProximaDB Ready!<br/>REST: http://localhost:5678<br/>gRPC: http://localhost:5679
    
    rect rgb(200, 255, 200)
        Note over Main,SE:  Key Design Benefits<br/>• No circular dependencies<br/>• Clean separation of concerns<br/>• Proper recovery order<br/>• Test Status: 890 passed, 0 failed
    end